title: Authorizations › Case page › Source chip
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042?tab=picture
intro: The small source chips that appear on three tabs. Clicking one opens the page of the chart it points to, with the sentence the agents used boxed.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the 'page' is a short generated sheet with the quoted sentence. The full document stays in the chart system.
---
group gW "Where chips appear"
  screen w1 "Clinical picture\nOne chip beside each of Diagnosis, Status, Trajectory, Readiness"
  screen w2 "Payer criteria\nOne chip in the 'Evidence' column of each requirement"
  screen w3 "Draft\nChips after each section\nEach sentence from an applied action adds its own"
endgroup
click c "Click a source chip\ne.g. 'Psychiatric eval p.1'"
overlay m "Dialog titled with the source name\n'Source for J.M., 34. Privacy mode is on.'"
doc d1 "Sheet 'Source document'\n'Names, dates of birth and member IDs are masked'"
doc d2 "Facts on the sheet\nPatient, Payer, Level of care, Request"
doc d3 "'What the agents used'\nThe quoted sentence, boxed and highlighted"
process ft "'The full document stays in the chart system. Reader read it and Integrity checked every sentence against it.'"
agent rd "Reader read the chart\nIntegrity checked each sentence against it\n(demo: the quote is stored text)"
decision dY "Is it a chip for an answer you typed?"
process yo "Chip reads 'Your answer'\nQuote: 'Typed by you for Scribe on this request.'"
click cl "Click 'Close'"
click x "Click the X"
click dim "Click the dimmed area"
click esc "Press Esc"
end e "Dialog closes\nYou are back on the same tab, nothing changed"

w1 --> c
w2 --> c
w3 --> c
c --> m --> d1 --> d2 --> d3 --> ft
d3 -.-> rd
c --> dY
dY -->|Yes| yo --> d3
dY -->|No| d3
m --> cl & x & dim & esc
cl --> e
x --> e
dim --> e
esc --> e
